{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01HLhYdkxeGQ4YBB9E9yDskp","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t+++\n2\tid = \"WI-540\"\n3\ttitle = \"The adjudicator session-retention layer: adjudicator_session.py, the [adjudicator] dial shipped at 0, dedicated homes\"\n4\tspecref = \"\"\n5\tworkstream = \"process\"\n6\tsr_refs = []\n7\tneeds = [\"WI-535\"]\n8\tbuildtier = \"strong\"\n9\tsafety_class = \"ordinary\"\n10\tpriority = 2\n11\t+++\n12\t\n13\t## Deliverable\n14\t\n15\t`adjudicator_session.py` — the retention layer's one home: the runtime session\n16\tSTORE (keyed `(family, route_id)`, atomic write-temp + `os.replace`), the\n17\tper-family resume-argv ADAPTER, the per-family OCCUPANCY / session-id READERS,\n18\tthe drain/reset RULE and the keep-warm TICK decision. Shipped INERT behind\n19\t`docs/process.toml [adjudicator] context_reset_pct = 0`\n20\t(`agent_common.adjudicator_config(...).enabled == False` short-circuits every\n21\tcaller), so the OFF path is byte-for-byte today's one-shot behaviour;\n22\t`run_session` (IF-064), `build_argv`'s `(argv, stdin_input)` contract and the\n23\t`adjudicate_brief` redaction seam are untouched. Wired into `agent_loop`\n24\t(`adjudicator_launch` / `_adjudicator_resume_record` / `adjudicator_bookkeeping`\n25\t/ `route_session`, with `resolve_session_setup`→`map_preflight` carrying the\n26\tloaded `adjudicate-*` template paths) and `dispatch` (keep-warm over\n27\t`load_family`). The `[adjudicator]` dial + its fail-closed-to-OFF row land in\n28\t`process.toml`(.template), `docs/enforcement-audit.md`, and the spine (IF-174\n29\towner declared by `adjudicator_session`; LLR-163 / TC-157 / IF-064 amendments).\n30\tTurning the dial ON and verifying it on-box is WI-541 (plan §5 step 4).\n31\t\n32\tREVIEW-A round 002 (CHANGES-REQUESTED, findings=6) fully addressed, one\n33\tregression test per finding: (1) the store keys by `(family, route_id)` so a\n34\troute switch never resumes another route's transcript